---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="People & Culture" description="A diverse workforce supported with professional development, internal promotion, and long-term retention.">

<main>

<section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-primary text-white">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10">
    <div class="mb-kenburns absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center" style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1497366216548-37526070297c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1800&q=80')"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#192e47e6] via-[#192e47bf] to-[#192e4766]"></div>
    <div class="mb-grid-overlay absolute inset-0 opacity-40"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 pb-24 pt-40 lg:px-10 lg:pb-32 lg:pt-48">
    <div class="mb-fade">
      <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.32em] text-white/70">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-white">Home</a><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/></svg><span class="text-white">People & Culture</span>
      </nav>
      <p class="mt-8 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.42em] text-white/70">Pillar 03 — People</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 max-w-4xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight text-white md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">People & Culture</h1>
      <div class="mt-10 h-px w-24 bg-white/40"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-card py-20 lg:py-24">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-12 px-6 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center lg:px-10">
    <div class="mb-fade">
      <div class="space-y-6 text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/85">
        <p>Millbrooke is powered by a diverse workforce and supplier network, all of whom share a commitment to achieving excellence. A direct representation of Millbrooke, our cleaners and industry specialists are supported and nurtured with professional development and knowledge enhancement opportunities, with a significant emphasis placed on internal promotion.</p>
        <p>Employee retention has little to do with Millbrooke's bottom line and everything to do with our position that employee satisfaction is the most effective strategy for success. Our staff are provided with the resources necessary to achieve professional growth and development through on-site training and support; progression planning; guidance and workplace feedback.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mb-fade" data-delay="120">
      <div class="h-80 w-full rounded-sm bg-cover bg-center lg:h-[520px]" style="background-image:url('/assets/people-culture.jpg')"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="mx-auto mt-16 grid max-w-5xl gap-5 px-6 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:px-10">
    <div class="flex h-full flex-col items-start gap-4 rounded-sm border border-border bg-background p-6 mb-fade" data-delay="0">
      <span class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-sm bg-primary text-white"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="3 17 9 11 13 15 21 7"/><polyline points="14 7 21 7 21 14"/></svg></span>
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-accent">Professional Development</p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex h-full flex-col items-start gap-4 rounded-sm border border-border bg-background p-6 mb-fade" data-delay="80">
      <span class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-sm bg-primary text-white"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="6"/><path d="M8.21 13.89L7 22l5-3 5 3-1.21-8.11"/></svg></span>
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-accent">Internal Promotion</p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex h-full flex-col items-start gap-4 rounded-sm border border-border bg-background p-6 mb-fade" data-delay="160">
      <span class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-sm bg-primary text-white"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg></span>
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-accent">Workforce Retention</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-primary text-white">
  <div class="mb-grid-overlay absolute inset-0 opacity-30"></div>
  <div class="absolute -right-32 top-1/2 h-[500px] w-[500px] -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full opacity-30 blur-3xl" style="background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(74,111,165,0.7), transparent 70%)"></div>
  <div class="relative mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-col items-start gap-8 px-6 py-20 lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:justify-between lg:px-10 lg:py-24">
    <div class="mb-fade">
      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.42em] text-white/60">Get in touch</p>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl">Interested in joining the Millbrooke team?</p>
    </div>
    <a href="/contact" class="group inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-white px-8 py-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-primary transition-all hover:bg-white/90 hover:shadow-2xl">Contact Us <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"/><polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"/></svg></a>
  </div>
</section>

</main>

</Layout>